    <message>
        <source>Type components in the box, or click them in the Components tab: the results follow as you pick. Strokes limits the stroke count of the whole character: 12 (exactly), &amp;lt;12 (fewer), &amp;gt;8 (more), 9-12 (between). A count typed after the components works too.</source>
